@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Smart-X Gateway";
}

<h1>Smart-X Data Ingestion &amp; Validation Gateway</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Hybrid IoT ecosystem for distributed environment monitoring — hydroponic farms, utility trackers, and smart grid installations.</p>

<div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-badge active">ACTIVE — PART 1</span>
        <h2>Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry</h2>
        <p>Register ESP32 sensor nodes, stream live telemetry through the generic ingestion API, watch anomaly detection and gamified health streaks in real time.</p>
        <a class="btn gold" asp-controller="Sensors" asp-action="Index">Open module →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card pillar-card disabled">
        <span class="pillar-badge disabled">DISABLED — PART 2</span>
        <h2>Real-Time Command Stream &amp; History</h2>
        <p>Bidirectional device commands and a replayable event history. Ships in Part 2 of the POE.</p>
        <button class="btn" disabled>Coming in Part 2</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card pillar-card disabled">
        <span class="pillar-badge disabled">DISABLED — FINAL POE</span>
        <h2>Network Topology &amp; Mesh Routing</h2>
        <p>Visualise the mesh network and routing between gateway nodes. Ships in the final POE submission.</p>
        <button class="btn" disabled>Coming in the final POE</button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <h2>Quick links</h2>
    <p class="subtitle" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Everything below belongs to the active Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry pillar.</p>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <a class="btn" asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index">Live Dashboard</a>
        <a class="btn" asp-controller="Deployment" asp-action="Index">Deployment Validator</a>
        <a class="btn" asp-controller="Aggregate" asp-action="Index">Meter Aggregation Demo</a>
    </div>
</div>
